# UI Rules

This project is a luxury fashion brand.

Never build generic ecommerce UI.

## Design Language

Minimal.

Editorial.

Elegant.

Premium.

Architectural.

Timeless.

## Inspiration

Use emotional inspiration from

- Apple
- COS
- Aesop
- Arc Browser
- OUTFIT

Never copy layouts.

## Layout

Large whitespace.

Strong typography.

Minimal navigation.

Large imagery.

Consistent spacing.

## Cards

Premium.

No clutter.

Soft shadows.

Elegant hover.

Large photography.

## Buttons

Simple.

Elegant.

Minimal.

Clear hierarchy.

## Forms

Large spacing.

Clear labels.

Accessible.

## Dark Theme

Dark-first.

Warm white text.

Neutral grays.

Avoid saturated colors.

## Never

Never use Bootstrap.

Never use Material UI.

Never use default browser styling.

Never create template-looking pages.

Every page should feel portfolio-quality.